{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026uJplUYVR971792747976.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《美食新聞報道》首站由蕭欣浩博士帶著黃嘉雯開展古風美食尋味之旅，造訪一間以著名劇作《牡丹亭》為主題的精緻餐廳。店內裝潢雕梁畫棟、極具古韻，料理方面則將傳統粵菜精華與創新烹調技藝相結合。<br/></p><p><strong>一、 尖沙咀「遊園」：古典牡丹亭主題 創新精緻粵菜</strong></p><p>位於尖沙咀戲曲中心的精緻餐廳「遊園」，以著名劇作《牡丹亭》為主題。店內裝潢雕梁畫棟、極具古韻，料理方面則將傳統粵菜精華與創新烹調技藝互相結合。蕭欣浩博士與黃嘉雯亦造訪此地，展開古風美食尋味之旅。</p><p>店內呈上的多道精緻料理均極具特色：</p><ul><li><p><strong>臘味糯米釀鳳翼</strong>：做工極其繁複的功夫菜，師傅展現精湛刀工將雞翼全隻去骨，皮薄餡多，裡面塞滿炒至香濃軟糯的臘味糯米飯，經高溫烤焙後外皮金黃酥脆。</p></li><li><p><strong>芫荽花椒水煮龍躉球</strong>：魚塊切得格外厚實且肉質極致爽滑，湯底融入大量鮮芫荽與特選花椒，花椒的麻香與辛辣風味特別突出，充分襯托出魚肉的鮮甜。</p></li><li><p><strong>焦糖菠蘿黑毛豬叉燒</strong>：嚴選優質西班牙黑毛豬，採用低溫慢煮技術鎖住肉汁，使肉質達到完美肥瘦適中的鬆軟口感，頂層搭配炙烤至香甜的焦糖菠蘿，酸甜果香巧妙中和了叉燒的油膩感，層次分明。</p></li><li><p><strong>柏薑蔥油蒸馬友魚</strong>：選用本地優質馬友魚，搭配特調柏薑與香濃蔥油慢火蒸熟，魚肉細嫩富含油脂，清香解膩。</p></li></ul><p><strong>店舖資料：</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>遊園</strong>：尖沙咀柯士甸道西88號戲曲中心地下2-3號舖</p></li></ul><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"fec4d2c4-d952-4be3-a0b1-0ddad6060e45.png-2.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026WWDbOb6TRv1792747977.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"a0ac1a7e-1e8c-4fe3-aba9-80383a56efd9.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026StFSWwC7ln1792747977.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"21253547-beae-44dd-bc0d-7bfc498ccc4f.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026suzGRMGnr91792747976.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"47e17ee8-591e-4146-8c1f-6bbfb1661c83.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Y9m1pQDwYx1792747976.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p><strong>二、 葵涌廣場：年輕人掃街熱點 人氣冷麵與健康甜品</strong></p><p>除了精緻粵菜，施焯日（Arthur）與波波（黃婧靈）亦來到深受年輕人喜愛的葵涌廣場展開美食之旅：</p><ul><li><p><strong>人氣冷麵店「五餸冷麵」</strong>：可點選溏心蛋、蜆肉、墨魚仔、芝麻八爪魚及帶子裙邊五款豐盛配料，店家更貼心大方贈送爆漿蟹籽。冷麵拌入特製醬汁後口感酸甜開胃、爽口彈牙，份量十足。</p></li><li><p><strong>超低糖質伯爵茶班戟</strong>：專為追求健康的人士打造。剛做好的班戟散發出濃郁撲鼻的天然蛋香與淡淡伯爵茶清香，質地輕盈軟糯，甜而不膩且低負擔。</p></li><li><p><strong>五福臨門老鼠粉</strong>：配料豐富的主食，包含叉燒、手撕雞、釀豬皮、肉條及煎蛋等，老鼠粉滑嫩吸汁，鹹香惹味。</p></li><li><p><strong>特色無酒精飲品店</strong>：店家將調酒的概念與手法融入無酒精手搖飲品中，不僅特調過程如調酒般極具觀賞性，飲品命名亦極具玩味與創意。</p></li></ul><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"86076866-2491-4eb8-bf55-21ad6ef3e3bd.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026lLIuXmUZMZ1792747978.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"168320c7-2616-49d7-9797-be503d6e46bd.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20267me4Hk2TiZ1792747978.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"8a6dcdd0-ee9c-40cd-91db-361cc28e7c3c.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026jsslSyUhss1792747978.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"6dc49627-4d3e-4c93-b10d-d6de95e67e61.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026YpBGbj4YyV1792747978.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"5042e220-7d2f-4ac7-972f-31896af19068.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20268MGVTjLonR1792747977.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:39.509299+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":888,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:38:45.379982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:37.131421+00:00","content_hash":"8e6ec6996035d85b7e5ebd84b805ca40dcc0f1d21a5b3a33b56273e268e98508","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:39.509299+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}